f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8148-0
00:55:49.941 --> 00:55:50.101
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Tak.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8151-0
