f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8160-1
00:55:55.178 --> 00:55:55.811
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>teda popasovat.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8172-0
00:55:56.221 --> 00:55:59.000
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>OK jo není možné,
