f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8293-4
00:56:46.644 --> 00:56:48.331
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>kde se to bude zapojovat.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8296-0
00:56:50.931 --> 00:56:51.451
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Který.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8301-0
00:56:52.811 --> 00:56:54.331
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Antila jsou tady no.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8371-0
00:56:55.931 --> 00:57:01.202
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Pátek budeme mít v pátek budeme mít
