f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8404-1
00:57:37.682 --> 00:57:39.581
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>procesem. A to co?</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8486-0
00:57:40.571 --> 00:57:44.850
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Vás tam jako nejvíc trápí,
