f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8513-0
00:58:23.701 --> 00:58:24.101
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Souvisí.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8521-0
