f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8593-0
00:58:54.011 --> 00:58:55.371
<v Tom&#225;š Lanzend&#246;rfer>Tak tak bych to taky řekl, no.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8627-2
00:58:57.637 --> 00:59:02.065
