f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8627-3
00:59:02.065 --> 00:59:03.651
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Jo, jo, to nechám na jo.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/8632-0
