f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12373-2
01:22:11.659 --> 01:22:12.961
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>že to je v pohodě, jo?</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12383-0
01:22:12.841 --> 01:22:16.881
