<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>jinej.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12409-0
01:22:24.621 --> 01:22:25.581
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Ne no je to on.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12430-0
01:22:27.671 --> 01:22:31.584
