f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12474-0
01:22:50.151 --> 01:22:51.391
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>A krve to nám tam.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12477-0
