f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12637-0
01:23:54.431 --> 01:23:54.791
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Jo.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12657-0
