<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>nabíječky. Abysme neblokovali element.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12715-0
01:24:23.621 --> 01:24:24.541
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>A data.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12717-0
01:24:25.961 --> 01:24:26.681
