f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12733-1
01:24:31.172 --> 01:24:32.351
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>budeme rádi za to.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12770-0
01:24:32.261 --> 01:24:34.599
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>Nejzažší to nejzažší to není.
