f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12770-3
01:24:40.656 --> 01:24:42.781
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>komunikujeme s těma s tou s tou cepenou.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12783-0
01:24:41.201 --> 01:24:45.535
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Dobře,
