f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12789-0
01:24:51.141 --> 01:24:52.581
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>U těch dat ano.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12795-0
01:24:53.541 --> 01:24:54.501
<v V&#225;clav Jir&#225;nek>Jo.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12826-0
01:24:53.631 --> 01:24:56.588
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>Tím, že jako element říkal,
