f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12840-0
01:25:05.411 --> 01:25:05.851
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>Ano.</v>

f6a1571e-2ffe-49ca-bd21-6e54241a0c19/12842-1
01:25:06.494 --> 01:25:06.951
